      yet — the fail-fast activates with the future dispatch wiring, and
      clients must be built through the factory until then.
    - cli_dispatcher_list_test: _decodedTools(raw:) renamed to
      lastLineOnly (review suggestion), gh-339 visibility group split out
      (method_size gate).
    - PR description item-3 rationale corrected: jira_download_attachment
      buffers via _http.getBytes (parity-correct; the Java OOM fix was
      transformer-only), it does not stream to disk.

