{"content":"💡 **SUGGESTION: misleading `raw` parameter name in `_decodedTools`**

`_decodedTools({bool raw = false})` — `raw` reads as "return raw strings" or "skip decoding", but the flag actually selects the response source: `true` decodes only `_lines.last`, `false` joins every collected line. Both branches `jsonDecode` into a `Map`. Consider `lastLineOnly` (or split into two helpers, `_lastResponseTools()` / `_joinedResponseTools()`) so the call sites (`_decodedTools(raw: true)` in the `contents` test) are self-explanatory.
